replies.message:
@Horizon F3 merely attempts to delete and re-add furry models to players. There are 7 human races/presets in the vanilla game, and these determine what furry race you will be. You need a race changing mod like
https//sotf-mods.com/mods/aedev/raceselector
to manually change it. After changing your race you should update to the furry version.
